Hello,

This is just to let you know that unstable tests are now tracked on:

  https://ci-results.mptcp.dev


It tracks tests executed by our CI when validating the export and
export-net branches, so results for patches sent on our ML.

We need to wait a bit to have more data, there were only 2 failures.

Please report any issues and/or suggestions!


The code behind is hosted on this Git repo:

  https://github.com/multipath-tcp/mptcp-upstream-tests-results/


PS: the CI is also now using virtme-ng!

